-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8509273_01.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- slider end -->\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">亞洲、歐洲及中東，以及美洲的投資者，分別佔52%、34%及14%。主權投資者、基金及資產管理公司、銀行及保險公司，以及交易商，則分別佔59%、29%、11%及1%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">財政部指，所有債券將在香港交易所掛牌買賣。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">（CGTN）</p>\n\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8509273_06.jpeg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8509273_06.jpeg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</p>\n</a>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8509273_04.jpeg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8509273_04.jpeg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</p>\n</a>\n\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8509273_05.jpeg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/11/screenshot_8509273_05.jpeg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</p>\n</a>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"http